<title>POLAND: BPH NOV NET RISES TO PLN 23.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>BPH NOV NET RISES TO PLN 23.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 23.89 vs   23.82</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   37.28 vs   40.56</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 60.11 vs   52.88</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	86.60 vs   84.94</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					264.14 vs  232.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  408.08 vs  352.31</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		620.57 vs  501.85</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     944.18 vs  929.71</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Przemyslowo</p>
<p>Handlowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
